(GreenLedger | Release Notes) Tj
T*
(Version 2.3.1 | Published November 12, 2026) Tj
T*
T*
(Summary) Tj
T*
(This maintenance release adds clearer review states to the monthly materials ledger and) Tj
T*
(improves the workflow for exporting a completed report.) Tj
T*
T*
(Ledger review) Tj
T*
(A report now displays Draft, Ready for review, or Approved. A user with Reviewer access) Tj
T*
(can move a report from Ready for review to Approved and add a review note. Authors may) Tj
T*
(return a report to Draft when corrections are needed. The activity panel records the) Tj
T*
(state change and the account that made it.) Tj
T*
T*
(Report download) Tj
T*
(The report menu now offers a comma-separated values download for the current reporting) Tj
T*
(period. The file includes category, facility, reporting month, quantity, unit, and) Tj
T*
(reviewer state. Downloading a report does not change its approval state.) Tj
T*
T*
(Usability improvements) Tj
T*
(The month selector retains its last-used value during a session. Empty categories are) Tj
T*
(hidden in the summary chart, but remain available in the detailed ledger. The release) Tj
T*
(includes performance work for opening large facility lists; no numerical improvement is) Tj
T*
(claimed.) Tj
T*
T*
(Availability) Tj
T*
(Version 2.3.1 is rolling out to hosted workspaces. Administrators using a private) Tj
T*
(installation should follow their normal upgrade process. The notes do not state a) Tj
T*
(minimum browser version or a fixed completion time for the hosted rollout.) Tj
T*
T*
(Not included) Tj
T*
(This release does not announce automatic emissions calculations, integrations with) Tj
T*
(accounting systems, mobile data entry, or export to spreadsheet formats other than CSV.) Tj
T*
(Do not describe those capabilities as part of this release without another source.) Tj
